","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:4434","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30121","characterName":"石上 沙恵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30121"},"originalCharacterName":"石上 沙恵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"As Yukari's cousin, Sae used to hang out with him all the time. However, as the pair grew older, they drifted apart. Now reunited at Platinum, Yukari sees how much Sae has grown up. She's confident and beautiful, but she's developed in some indecent ways as well, and she can't wait to show him those, either."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30121"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/361cfcbe878a9d30ac2b86ad313bc746941fa29ec6b3bb4325f872afd33fa228.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0ee63294c1a56804b481712fcc83c8d58ff1ce21ccd9271d5d6e9310d756a71.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30122","characterName":"鵠沼 涼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30122"},"originalCharacterName":"鵠沼 涼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even though she's the youngest of the bunch, Ryou naturally takes charge when it comes to work. This discipline comes from a traditional and strict upbringing. With such a background, though, it's odd that she would work in such a revealing atmosphere, but it seems to have given her plenty of hidden cravings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30122"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e9c7b2d62b2913b22d30baf412c3f7f34ed3a6a0f43bee3fe4f212834b183a9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/51767014d5d086144e99d86ff1faf316a4dd96155609778fbffcc52461131c30.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30123","characterName":"柳 ひろみ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30123"},"originalCharacterName":"柳 ひろみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sae's best friend seems like the least likely type of person to work in a bunny uniform. She wears glasses and seems a bit insulated. She especially lacks confidence when it comes to interacting with guys. Fortunately, she has no problems opening up to Yukari!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30123"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4dd87f168f83b1ef727f7a0cdf3cc8bdedda1180e692f66a12567495a4fdf30f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b2574b9f343db5345a68ae44a77133ebe4ffc611d64c648cf030bf127d87c8f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30124","characterName":"長谷 ちまき","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30124"},"originalCharacterName":"長谷 ちまき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chimaki may look young and immature, and she certainly acts that way, but she is actually the oldest waitress of the bunch. She's certainly not ashamed of that fact, or much of anything else, and is more than happy to act out her kinky perversions with her newest colleague."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30124"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba70e610fe9002afee75ce819376c878ebbc21c1fb0c3804b2b8ffefa7ebbf74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5cde9df8e9dd64d45cf9b796ec513a839f70baf857f1f590a9f16d54b4ece4b3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30125","characterName":"稲村 明菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30125"},"originalCharacterName":"稲村 明菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akina is the manager of Platinum. She may seem a bit insane at first. After all, she can't resist jumping on anyone she finds cute, man or woman. Underneath that though, well, she's still a crazed sex machine. Whenever she pops up, prepare for the unexpected."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30125"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e09e6b7dc128d85326748120d87f9286c6fbb241687a9aee2315f4204f94016.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eeea1851c3c78d12073eeef3eaea47770c67ab5d6c18f1956d93b5b1fb12e1f5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59928","characterName":"藤沢 縁","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59928"},"originalCharacterName":"藤沢 縁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cursed with a small build and cute face, the high school senior has often been mistaken for a girl throughout his life. However, this supposed weakness is about to become his ticket into paradise. Looking for something to do in his spare time, Yukari applies for a job at Platinum, an exclusive Italian eatery. Even though the opening is really for women, his irresistable cuteness lands him the post. He hasn't been able to land himself a girlfriend yet, but hopefully that will change at Platinum!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59928"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/118dc6161b373d48fc07c44e3f3533d9073c6103f0c58ca70b573d7c5ca698ac.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2ac31182255e2fba3ebbcce41549bc886b36600878815d3ab9ad283689c3d429.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59937","characterName":"Wada Shuntaro","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59937"},"originalCharacterName":"Wada Shuntaro","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A wine server at Platinum who works a